    "그럼 이건 어때요. 내일 바로 해낼 수 있을 만큼 작게 만든다면, 뭐가 될까요?" : {
      "comment" : "조약돌 문구 — Phrasing.say/pick 이 실행 중에 찾는다",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wie wäre das: Wenn du es so klein machst, dass du es morgen gleich schaffst, was wäre es?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Then how about this. If you made it small enough to finish tomorrow, what would it be?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Then how about this. If you made it small enough to finish tomorrow, what would it be?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Y si lo haces tan pequeño que mañana mismo puedas lograrlo? ¿Qué sería?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et si on faisait ainsi : en le rendant assez petit pour le réussir dès demain, ce serait quoi ?"
