    "무엇에 닿았고 무엇이 막혔는지, 제가 먼저 보고 말을 걸게요." : {
      "comment" : "조약돌 문구 — Phrasing.say/pick 이 실행 중에 찾는다",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ich sehe zuerst nach, was du erreicht hast und was dich aufgehalten hat, und spreche dich dann an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'll watch what you reach and what gets stuck, and I'll speak first."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'll watch what you reach and what gets stuck, and I'll speak first."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veré hasta dónde llegaste y qué te frenó, y te hablaré yo primero."
