    "상황은 알겠어요. 그래서 지금 어떤 기분이에요?" : {
      "comment" : "조약돌 문구 — Phrasing.say/pick 이 실행 중에 찾는다",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Situation habe ich verstanden. Wie fühlst du dich jetzt?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I see the situation. So how are you feeling?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I see the situation. So how are you feeling?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entiendo la situación. ¿Y cómo te sientes ahora?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "J’ai compris la situation. Et comment vous sentez-vous maintenant ?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "状況はわかりました。それで、今の気分はどうですか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상황은 알겠어요. 그래서 지금 어떤 기분이에요?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ситуация понятна. А что вы чувствуете сейчас?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情况我明白了。那你现在心情怎么样？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情況我明白了。那你現在心情怎麼樣？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "상황이 막힌 거지, 사람이 문제인 게 아니에요." : {
      "comment" : "조약돌 문구 — Phrasing.say/pick 이 실행 중에 찾는다",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Situation hat sich festgefahren, nicht du bist das Problem."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The situation got stuck. That is not the same as you being the problem."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The situation got stuck. That is not the same as you being the problem."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que se atascó fue la situación, no tú."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C’est la situation qui est bloquée, pas vous qui êtes en cause."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "状況が行き詰まっているだけで、あなたに問題があるわけではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상황이 막힌 거지, 사람이 문제인 게 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Это ситуация зашла в тупик, а не вы виноваты."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "是情况卡住了，不是你这个人有问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "是情況卡住了，不是你這個人有問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
